WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.090
The Kokuboro were thought
to have retreated.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.530
However, they had not
given up on Karasumori.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.530
The Chief of the Night Troops,
Masamori,

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.730
moved the headquarters
of the Night Troops

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.870
to Karasumori in order to
counter the Kokuboro.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:24.050
And now, the Kokuboro have brought
their might to Karasumori.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:30.090
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.960
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:37.170
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.070
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.500
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.910
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.450
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.780
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.450
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.950
Sha la la la la...

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:10.370
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.330
(Secret romance)

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.540
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:19.300
(A strange distance)

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:26.150
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:27.220
Yeah

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:30.690
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.290
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:39.630
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.510
It's time, my babe.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.350
All right!

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.880
Yukimasa-dono, let us go!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.750
Yeah!

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.010
Let's go!

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.770
All right! Who wants to hit this?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.310
I shall-

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.140
Me! Me! Me!

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.370
I-I was first...

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:30.940
Here you go.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:33.070
Leave it to me.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.310
I'll hit it right down the center!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.350
Destroy every single one of them!

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.880
Don't let them set foot
on this land again!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:15.790
Make them regret
they made enemies of us!

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.850
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.030
Fly.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:43.350
M-My babe.
You mustn't eat those things!

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.050
Just crush them!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.810
Sun Flare Ball!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.080
Moon Blade!

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:56.490
That was close!
Think before you throw, Hakudo!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.690
Yaichi!

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:05.810
Always be on guard.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:09.140
It's your fault
for being slow, Yaichi-dono.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.270
W-What... did you say?!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.180
- What are you doing?!
- Stop quarreling, Yaichi!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.200
You lump of sand!

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.810
And Tsukinojo, stop teasing him!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.920
Ketsu! Ketsu!
Metsu!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.650
Ketsu!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.190
Ketsu!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.290
Metsu!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.330
Where are you, Kaguro?
Come out!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.670
I wonder if Yoshi and the others
are okay...

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:44.010
You don't need to worry.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.040
I'm counting on you.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:48.850
If anything happens,
I'll look after your affairs...

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:50.850
Maybe we should have a tea break.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:56.420
Shuji-san. I don't want to say this but...
Aren't you a bit too relaxed?

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:01.890
Father, don't forget that I am
the dad of those two boys.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.130
I know them,
I know they'll make it happen.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.500
Now then, Toshimori.
Let's go back inside.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:13.430
Okay.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.750
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.350
Ketsu!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.680
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.260
Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu! Metsu!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:42.930
Yoshimori!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:43.940
Are you okay?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.600
Yes.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.810
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.200
Annoying little!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.350
Yoshimori!
It's avoiding the shadows!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.450
That's its weakness!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.520
All right! I'll take care of it!
Ketsu!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.250
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.350
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:08.420
Ketsu!

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.700
Hey. Where is Kaguro?

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.040
Kaguro-san?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.400
Is he here?

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.870
I-I saw him here.
I saw him from a distance.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:20.840
Where is he?!

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.740
He's somewhere!

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.940
I need more information
than that! Metsu!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:27.380
Where is he?!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.370
Yoshimori!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:34.380
Kaguro is here! Where is he?!
Where is he?!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.220
What's happening with Karasumori?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.800
We are conducting
a general offensive.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:49.790
I see.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:54.800
Sakon shall present you
with Karasumori, Princess.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.740
That little boy?

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:59.070
You left him in charge of
the Karasumori offensive?

00:06:59.310 --> 00:06:59.970
Yes.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:05.810
I hate him. I never know
what he's thinking.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:10.650
I know you hate him.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:14.290
I also know he's
plotting something.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.590
Then why?

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:20.390
Everything is useful
in its own way.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.550
Such a big deal was made
about the Night Troops,

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.450
but they aren't much after all.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:41.350
They seem to be satisfying themselves
by fighting only the weaklings.

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:47.480
It's strange...

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.860
This is the attack
by the Kokuboro?

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.260
They're too weak.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.130
There is some ulterior motive or

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.000
maybe they can't mobilize
their main forces...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:03.680
Yaichi-dono seems to be
making himself useful.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.340
Ketsu!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.250
Metsu!

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.150
Ketsu, Ketsu, Ketsu! Metsu!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.920
Kaguro! Where are you?!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.390
There's so many of them.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.940
What is he looking for?

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.850
Sakon-sama. Are you sure you
want to let things go as they are?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:45.650
Many of your underlings are dying...

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:58.730
I hate it when subordinates
tell me what to do.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:09.070
Now then.
Time for the star of the show.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.650
I won't get anything
done at this rate.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.250
Mukade!
Lend me one of your legs!

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.320
One leg starting at 1000 yen...

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:20.910
When did you start
a business like that?!

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.120
Chief said that we don't need to
hold back even among ourselves.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.420
I think you misinterpreted him!

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:30.360
At least make it a bit cheaper!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:32.920
Takemitsu seems
to be really excited.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.270
Ohdo, give me a ball, too!
I'm gonna hit it!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:37.800
What's wrong?

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.300
That looks bad...

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:08.570
Yaichi-dono!

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:10.040
Thank... you...

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:15.040
It's so powerful!

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.770
Completely different
from the other Ayakashi!

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:19.970
Hang on tight!

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.010
Retreat!

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.450
What is this overwhelming aura?

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:03.880
It's different from Gagin!
It's a lot more evil!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:11.130
You must be the Night Troops.
Nice to meet you. I am Sakon.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.830
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:19.100
My Task Force One has come to
take Karasumori tonight.

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.160
Moon Blade!

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:22.630
Sun Flare Ball!

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.040
Fly!

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:39.520
Oh, my. Is this the best
the Night Troops can do?

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:42.360
I suggest that you give it
everything you have.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:45.160
Ketsu!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.630
Then I'll do it!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:48.870
Yoshimori!

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.060
What is it now?!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:54.040
I smell it! It's close!
It's the human skin.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.730
That black-haired one.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.970
What?! Where?!

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:01.580
I'm telling you because
you told me to tell you,

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:02.570
but are you sure about this?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.620
You're going to be leaving
that Sakon to everyone.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.290
Big brother!
Please take care of the rest!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.300
There's something I have to do!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.330
Let's go! Take me there!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:22.800
Yoshimori! Where are you going
at a time like this?!

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:24.560
Don't come!

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:32.440
You think I'm just
going to let you go?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.490
Where is he going? He's getting
further away from Karasumori.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:44.050
Sen-chan,
you can't leave your post!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.350
There's nothing for us to do here!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.600
Where is the so-called Kekkaishi
protecting this land?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:13:00.100
I've had enough of the cohorts
of the kid killed by Gagin-sama.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.130
It won't be fun fighting you.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.910
You take that back!
Gen didn't die helplessly!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:13.850
I understand that you want to
protect the kid's honor.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:17.820
Gen was only one step away
from defeating Gagin!

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:23.060
But he died, did he not?
The human world is very nice...

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:25.430
Your honor is protected
so long as you die.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:28.260
You shut up! Tsukinojo! Get him!

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:38.880
I went on a diet...

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.610
Yaichi-dono!
Allow me to assist you!

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:41.270
Sure.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.120
Tsukinojo!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.820
I'm trying my best!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.690
This is your best?

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:01.890
Yaichi!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:19.650
This is nothing compared to
the pain Gen felt...

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:23.410
This is nothing compared to
the suffering Gen experienced...

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:28.290
Nothing good has ever come
from fighting in blind rage.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.990
Right down the center!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.170
Stop!

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.470
Everyone retreat!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.950
I don't want any casualties!
Everyone stand back!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:56.420
You don't want casualties?
How naïve of you.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.320
Battles always produce casualties.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.830
It is naïve to think that
we will suffer casualties

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.230
from the likes of you.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:10.870
Must be hard as the leader,
putting on a brave face for your men.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:23.080
Karasumori is not for you to take.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.350
I finally get to meet
the Kekkaishi.

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:30.990
But it seems you're
not the Legitimate Heir.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:43.600
I've been looking for you, Kaguro!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.740
Oh? Are you alone?

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.310
I was told if I came like this,

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:02.690
that two Kekkaishi with dogs
would find me.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:09.520
What a pain.
I guess one Kekkaishi will do...

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.420
It's not my fault, anyway.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.330
You're not... Kaguro?!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.260
Where's Kaguro?!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.670
Who are you?! Where's Kaguro?!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:21.570
Capture him.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:23.910
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.650
Not bad.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:28.680
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.150
This is getting fun.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.960
It's been a while since someone
made me get serious.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.590
I've got a lively one here.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.660
What are you?! Who are you?!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.600
I'm Shion.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.500
This might be a little sudden,
but you're coming with me.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:55.630
You'll find Kaguro
if you come to Kokuboro.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:57.880
Then take me there!

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.070
What?!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:02.780
Huh? Do you even understand
what you're saying?

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.380
Yeah, Yoshimori!
Get a hold of yourself!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.520
Shut up!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:09.080
Damn it! You're always like this.

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.120
Shut up for a second.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:15.060
No, I won't! Do you understand
what you're doing?!

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.460
Chatty little dog, aren't you?!

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.760
Think before you act...

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:25.770
Kaguro is there, right?
Then take me there!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.470
What? This messes up things a bit.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:32.400
Oh, well.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.410
If he wants to go, then fine.
It'll save me some trouble.

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.210
I don't really get it,
but I'll take you there.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.650
What's with him?!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.120
He wants to be taken there?
What's he thinking?!

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:56.260
She found me?

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.790
No, I completely
shut off my presence.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.020
What should I do?
Should I just kill him?

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:23.890
Wait. They told me to
bring two Kekkaishi.

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.430
I'll just pass him off
as the other Kekkaishi.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.830
All right. Let's go back, guys!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.510
Which way is it?

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.180
The smell of the human skin
suddenly disappeared

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.380
and got mixed with the scent
of other Ayakashi.

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:46.720
No excuses!
Where is Yoshimori?!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.090
Oh, honey! Look!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.390
Madarao, get ahold of yourself!
Where's Yoshimori?!

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:58.460
What are you saying?!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:01.160
Honey, that's going
a bit overboard.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.390
Oh, right.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.240
That idiot...

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.330
Yoshimori...

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:12.480
You're bringing the Kekkaishi here?

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.810
I ordered Shion to do so.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.510
That's no fun. So you're not
going to take over Karasumori.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.180
Please consider it "Plan B."

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.320
Even if we fail to
take over Karasumori,

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:28.780
this mission is a success
if we get the Kekkaishi.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.350
Why?

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:31.520
Excuse me for saying this,

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.130
but your powers have
severely waned.

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:35.460
I didn't know!

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:37.800
In order to maintain this castle,

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:41.070
we will utilize
the Kekkaishi's ability

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:43.040
to manipulate space.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.340
Is that possible?

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.540
Most likely.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.440
But will they agree to it?

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:52.380
If the need arises,
I will use my worm.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:58.820
No! I keep telling you!
I hate being looked at by that eye!

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.880
I-I'm terribly sorry.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.160
Please forgive me.
Princess, please face me once more.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.530
It was very funny seeing you panic.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.400
I like that part about you.

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.080
You jest yet again.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:27.390
But without Shion, Sakon would
be attacking Karasumori.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.850
Are you sure you want to
leave him by himself?

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.820
If he succeeds,
it would be most fortunate.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.290
We can deal with him afterwards.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:46.730
I, Sakon, declare that
Karasumori will be mine.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.840
Very well. I'll fight you
with everything I have.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.040
That would be a problem.

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.040
Atora!

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:01.820
Now what are you going to do?

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:04.210
You can fight me with
everything you have.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.960
But I may break your friend's neck.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.870
Grandpa, the black clouds
are moving away!

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:20.930
What?!

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.400
Did they manage to
fend off the Kokuboro?

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:28.770
But there are still black clouds
over the school.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.780
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.710
They are retreating while leaving
the main forces behind.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.070
What are you going to do, honey?

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:56.270
I have to rescue
that idiot somehow.

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:07.020
Wh-Who are you?!

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:11.180
Take me to Kokuboro!
Or do you want to be destroyed?

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:13.890
O-Okay, I'll take you!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:18.760
Honey, this is as far as we can be
away from Karasumori.

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:20.860
I'm leaving Yoshimori
in your hands!

00:22:20.930 --> 00:22:21.920
I'll take care of it!

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:52.760
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:57.170
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:01.470
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:05.900
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:18.390
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:27.130
Even if I search the whole world,
no one could replace you

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:31.960
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:40.570
Don't cry

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:49.320
Even if I search the whole world
no one could replace you

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:54.150
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:54.190 --> 00:24:02.570
Don't cry
